    EXEC_23: implement explicit air gap reflector geometry
    
    Geometry:
    - src/DetectorConstruction.cc: add explicit 0.10 mm optical air-gap panels around lateral faces
    - src/DetectorConstruction.cc: add external 0.05 mm Mylar reflector panels and border surfaces
    - src/Materials.cc: make AirGap->Reflector dielectric_metal polished with R=0.95
    
    Validation:
    - geometry overlap check PASS
    - speed gate PASS, max v/(c/n)=1.0 and superluminal fraction=0
    - <Npe>_END(0): EXEC_22b 0.763 -> EXEC_23 2035.26 in 50-event diagnostic
    - sigma_END(0): 60.12 ps diagnostic, bootstrap unstable due small sample
    - flagged as not baseline: Npe > 300 and 500-event center run exceeded practical wall-clock
    
    No ROOT data committed.

